  "description": "The True Celestial Demon of the Heavenly Demon God Clan was a menace, striking fear into his enemies. After an untimely demise, the True Celestial Demon finds himself reborn... as a baby? A baby in the care of the Kunlun School, at that! Jing Guang, as he's now called, is determined to become an even greater martial artist in this life, but something seems off about the Kunlun School's technique. Can Guang use his knowledge and experience to transcend the Kunlun School and his former self? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
